MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Blink whole-home bundle feels like a useful next step because it adds camera coverage to my existing door alarms and works with the Alexa devices I already use.",
    "The 2021 Fire HD 10 interests me because a larger portable entertainment screen would add a use my Fire TV and small Echo Show do not fully cover."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Fire TV Stick 4K, first-generation Show 5, and third-generation Dot repeat needs covered by my recent, newer devices, so their familiarity does not give me a reason to choose them now.",
    "Several options appeal to me without being purchases I would make together: I would choose the newer HD 10 over the other tablets and start with the whole-home camera bundle before adding three indoor cameras."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My recent Alexa purchases seem to be treated as interest in almost any Echo or Fire device, even when it would duplicate something I just bought.",
    "Similar functions seem to count too strongly: another streaming stick or small smart speaker is related to my history but does not necessarily add anything useful."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent device generations matter: buying a fourth-generation Dot, second-generation Show 5, and Fire TV Stick 4K Max makes older equivalents less compelling.",
    "The Show 5 stand suggests I am still outfitting my recent purchase, while my history of adapters, replacement batteries, and peripherals shows that supporting equipment can be more useful than another main device."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my interest in connected home electronics but miss how much my next choice depends on adding a useful capability to what I already own."
}
